The `sort_links` function sorts the links alphabetically in a case-insensitive manner.

The `scrape_webpage` function takes a URL and a keyword as parameters, creates an instance of the `LinkParser` class, and calls the `parse` method to extract the links. It then sorts the links and prints them.

