Create a dictionary with key-value pairs for characters and their nicknames in the Lord of the Rings, using their races as the nickname. 
Additionally, implement Levenshtein distance algorithm to handle any typos or ambiguities in the character names when checking the nicknames.

Characters:
Frodo - Hobbit;
